│                          │ handling to further cut spurious reversals without meaningful phase delay. This hybrid    │
│                          │ exploits the Kalman's noise-adaptive smoothing and the quadratic fit's zero-lag           │
│                          │ extrapolation, targeting slope_changes, false_reversals, and smoothness while preserving  │
│                          │ the lag and accuracy gains.                                                               │
