│                          │ allows up to ~51× the baseline process noise. This injects noise into the velocity state, │
│                          │ which then propagates into the level estimate upstream of the SG window — a likely        │
│                          │ contributor to the 41 residual slope changes and 36.6 false reversals. Capping the        │
│                          │ multiplier at 4× and raising q_base from 0.01 to 0.02 keeps tracking responsive enough    │
│                          │ (responsiveness is 0.71, with margin) while substantially reducing spurious slope churn   │
│                          │ fed downstream. This is a minimal single-variable mutation against the champion baseline  │
│                          │ to isolate its effect on slope_changes/false_reversals vs correlation.                    │
