│ patch_description        │ Crossover of the current champion (score 0.63: bidirectional adaptive Kalman + robust SG  │
│                          │ with 2W+3 window + Stage 3.5 median snap on x_smooth + final level-domain snap) with the  │
│                          │ inspiration script (score 0.62: unidirectional Kalman + robust SG with 2W-1 window +      │
│                          │ global-sigma snap). The bidirectional Kalman fusion and the locally adaptive rolling-MAD  │
│                          │ threshold from the champion are the strongest proven components, so they are retained.    │
│                          │ From the inspiration script we adopt the more conservative SG window sizing insight,      │
│                          │ settling at an intermediate odd window of 2W+1, which reduces residual ripple (improving  │
│                          │ slope changes/false reversals) while the bidirectional Kalman and recency-weighted        │
│                          │ convolution recover the small added group delay. The Stage 3.5 median snap is kept with a │
│                          │ slightly stronger blend (0.6) to further push noise reduction, and the final snap retains │
│                          │ the vectorized sliding-window median with the locally adaptive 0.5σ threshold. All stages │
│                          │ remain fully vectorized for O(n) efficiency.                                              │
