│ patch_description        │ Structural redesign from a flat function chain into a composable stage-object pipeline    │
│                          │ (PredictFusePipeline) where each stage owns its parameters and reports a noise-scale      │
│                          │ contract to the next stage. Key architectural changes: (1) a shared SignalContext carries │
│                          │ the raw signal, denoised signal, and noise sigma so every stage is calibrated against the │
│                          │ same robust noise estimate instead of re-estimating; (2) the bidirectional Kalman is      │
│                          │ rewritten as a forward filter + backward RTS-style smoother information fusion (single    │
│                          │ sweep per direction, covariance-aware 50/50 blend) which lowers lag error; (3)            │
│                          │ noise-dominated wavelet scales are fully hard-killed (no residual pass) while a new       │
│                          │ per-scale SURE-style criterion decides signal-bearing scales, directly attacking the      │
│                          │ weakest metric (noise_reduction 0.37) without touching correlation-bearing scales; (4) a  │
│                          │ new final DirectionalHysteresis stage with sign-consistency smoothing over a 3-tap slope  │
│                          │ vote reduces slope_changes and false_reversals; (5) the predictive edge-polynomial stage  │
│                          │ now blends a center-evaluated and edge-evaluated quadratic in a noise-adaptive ratio      │
│                          │ (more lead when SNR is high), improving responsiveness. Output contract (len = n - W + 1, │
│                          │ same API) preserved exactly.                                                              │
